  "headline": "Prabowo Gathers Coalition Leaders To Discuss New Vice President",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Convenes Coalition Leaders at Hambalang",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto will meet with coalition party leaders at his Hambalang residence to deliberate on potential vice presidential candidates.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto scheduled a meeting with coalition political party leaders before November 25.",
    "The discussions are primarily focused on identifying a candidate to replace Gibran Rakabuming Raka as Vice President.",
    "Golkar Party chairman Bahlil Lahadalia noted that Sufmi Dasco Ahmad is among the names under consideration for the position."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the vacancy in the office of the Vice President, President Prabowo Subianto is coordinating with leaders of his supporting coalition parties to determine a successor. Several coalition members, including representatives from the Democratic Party and the Prosperous Justice Party (PKS), have confirmed receiving requests to remain available for these consultations. While early reports placed these meetings at the Bogor Palace, recent updates indicate the President intends to host the party chairmen at his residence in Hambalang. Public discussion has identified various political figures as potential candidates, with the Golkar Party recently suggesting that Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives Sufmi Dasco Ahmad is included in current preference considerations. The ongoing selection process follows the departure of Gibran Rakabuming Raka from the vice presidential office, prompting intensive high-level negotiations among the governing coalition partners.",
